you're a triple refugee.

00:01:27.594 --> 00:01:28.484
- Yeah (laughs).
- Amazing.

00:01:28.484 --> 00:01:30.141
I know, and I--

00:01:30.141 --> 00:01:32.904
- You know, I came to
America as a refugee.

00:01:32.904 --> 00:01:36.234
