00:01:57.504 --> 00:01:59.494
'cause I'm so fascinated by this story,

00:01:59.494 --> 00:02:01.614
which was the biggest culture shock?

00:02:01.614 --> 00:02:03.314
I know you were young all along,

00:02:03.314 --> 00:02:07.764
